    'nuances' => array(
        'Resolve each repeated noun phrase, product, person or unit name once per page and copy that exact string into every slot: <title>, H1, breadcrumb, eyebrow, chip, hero, bullet, spec label, every FAQ question and answer, the CTA, cards, alt and aria — the FAQ answer and the CTA copy it, only re-declined; reuse any Polish the page already carries. Wrong: H1 „Skrzynia rozdzielcza napędu” beside hero „System skrzynki odgałęźnej”. Right: „skrzynia rozdzielcza napędu” in both.',
        'Use one Polish term per concept and one label per UI object, canonical form from the nav or footer, and one wording when a sentence repeats across slots (meta, og:description, JSON-LD, title attribute, heading). Two different English labels in one menu stay different („Training” = „Szkolenia”, „Training courses” = „Oferta szkoleń”). Wrong: chip „Systemy badawcze” over cards „Systemy testowe”. Right: „Systemy testowe” in both.',
